          <parameter uniqueID="UID_PARAM_2104" access="readWrite">
            <label lang="en">PIDParam</label>
            <description lang="en">PID general settings. 

err = I_read(feedback) - I_target(reference);

prop = Comp_PID_P(s, dt, err);
inte = Comp_PID_I(s, dt, err);
deriv = Comp_PID_D(s, dt, err);
out = prop + inte + deriv;
return out;

Correction is scaled with M_factor:
PID.M_factor = (float)PWM_MAX / Valve[ev_idx].Valve_map.maxCurrent;

Is the ratio between PWM resolution and max current that can be reached on that valve</description>
            <denotation>
              <label lang="en" />
            </denotation>
            <defaultValue value="" />
          </parameter>
